notes={
'DATUM':('Product information, made easier to compare.','A technical catalog study organising measuring instruments around task, range and specification.','Keep selection guidance and product data consistent across a twelve-page document. Readers need to compare instruments without confusing range, resolution and accuracy.',['Editable comparison tables and product records','A stable typographic hierarchy for technical information','Credited instrument photography with clear context']),
'MATERIAL':('A magazine about objects, processes and places.','An editorial publication exploring clay, printing and shared reading spaces.','Move between full-page photography and sustained reading while keeping the publication coherent. The sixteen-page issue uses changes in scale and pace to separate its features.',['Threaded editorial text and distinct feature openers','Serif reading text, pull quotes and supporting captions','Full-image pages balanced with quieter reading spreads']),
'CIVIC':('Figures with context, structure and a clear sequence.','A business-report study with illustrative energy and financial data.','Turn a sample operating scenario into a navigable report. Tables, charts and explanations need consistent definitions and figures that reconcile.',['Native editable tables and chart artwork','Executive overview, programme plan and risk register','Sample totals reconciled across the report']),
'Fieldnote':('An outdoor itinerary in six folded panels.','A roll-fold travel brochure study balancing scenic imagery with practical copy.','Arrange the outer sheet in tuck, back and front order, then create a readable three-panel itinerary on the inside.',['Separate outer and inner sheet arrangements','Non-printing fold guides in the source document','Panel-based copy and proportionate image crops']),
'Courtyard':('A compact property brochure with room to breathe.','A square-format study combining interior photography and planning information.','Use a restrained four-page sequence: cover, introduction, reference information and closing page.',['Square format and circular detail crop','Editable planning-allowance table','Contrasting full-image and information pages']),
'Thread':('Archive, street and material in one visual sequence.','A clothing and textile lookbook study with tall crops and offset compositions.','Move between a contemporary street photograph, archive displays and material detail without presenting the images as a retail collection.',['Tall portrait format and asymmetrical image placement','Serif headlines and large editorial numerals','A practical image-selection checklist']),
'Daily Form':('A botanical catalog with a clear product hierarchy.','A beauty catalog study pairing floral photography with flat packaging illustrations.','Give each sample product a clear role and a consistent information order. The pack artwork is visibly illustrated, rather than presented as product photography.',['Editable vector packaging illustrations','Product names, sample sizes and prices in a stable hierarchy','A collection index and botanical detail crops']),
'Table':('A tall menu with calm, readable price alignment.','A four-page seasonal menu study with serif headings and credited food imagery.','Keep item names, supporting descriptions and prices easy to scan in a narrow page format.',['Consistent price alignment','Native drinks table','Tall format with restrained image use']),
'Neighbour':('A small journal with a newspaper rhythm.','A community newsletter study covering shared spaces, repair and reading.','Use a masthead, compact columns and feature photography to give four pages a clear editorial sequence.',['Two-column reading pages','A clear newsletter masthead and issue hierarchy','A quieter reading-list back page']),
'Harbor':('A company profile organised around a concrete offer.','A fictional operations-studio profile with services and a practical engagement sequence.','Explain what the sample business does, how an engagement progresses and where responsibility sits.',['Three-column service structure','An editable stage-and-output table','Strong cover colour and a quieter interior system']),
'Clearwater':('A concise annual review that shows its working.','A six-page annual-report study using reconciled illustrative figures.','Separate workload, resolution rate and simplified financial information so the report remains easy to interpret.',['Native bar-chart artwork','An editable financial summary','Explicit sample-data definitions and rounded percentages']),
'Common Ground':('Participation, presented with context.','A nonprofit impact-report study using illustrative programme activity.','Distinguish activity measures from claims of long-term impact, and show how sample resource totals reconcile.',['Editable activity and resource tables','Clear metric hierarchy','A distinct green identity and observational photography']),
'Gridshift':('A practice paper built for sustained reading.','A white-paper study about clearer internal operating documents.','Create a short argument with an executive summary, practical framework and review method.',['Readable two-column text','An editable comparison table','A restrained monochrome system with a lime accent']),
'Northline':('A proposal with a visible scope and review sequence.','A landscape publication-proposal study for a visitor-guide brief.','Make deliverables, responsibilities and approvals easy to compare before production begins.',['Editable scope and programme tables','Landscape format with numbered sections','A clear separation of client inputs and change control']),
'Make Room':('A workbook that leaves space for the reader.','An eight-page planning workbook with prompts, comparison cells and writing lines.','Balance instruction with usable writing space, rather than filling every page with decorative content.',['Editable prompts and comparison table','Native ruled writing areas','A paced sequence from observation to review']),
'Signal':('A small identity system people can use.','An eight-page brand-guide study with typography, colour and layout examples.','Demonstrate how a wordmark, accent colour and type hierarchy work together in practical applications.',['Native wordmark and colour samples','Typography and clear-space guidance','An editable notice-layout example']),
'Structure':('A study of surface, rhythm and the built edge.','A landscape architecture publication using independently credited building photography.','Shift between a reflective façade and a wider street view without claiming authorship of the photographed buildings.',['Landscape editorial format','Large image crops and three-column observations','Clearly attributed architectural references']),
'Stillhouse':('A hospitality brochure with a slower rhythm.','A square brochure study using arch-shaped frames and restrained serif typography.','Balance an atmospheric introduction with practical information structure. The photographs are independently sourced references, not a property offered for booking.',['Arch-shaped and elliptical image frames','Serif headlines with concise supporting copy','An editable room-information table']),
'Open House':('A visitor guide that makes space for a question.','A compact exhibition-guide study moving between context, detail and visitor prompts.','Keep explanatory labels separate from reflective questions and offer a page for visitors to record an observation.',['Tall compact format','Circular object-detail crop','Editable visitor prompts and writing lines']),
'Pattern':('Texture, scale and a consistent reference system.','A landscape textile-reference catalog with specimen crops and information fields.','Explore how crop and scale change the reading of a surface while keeping live supplier claims out of the sample content.',['Landscape product-reference layout','Editable specification-field table','Contrasting circular and rectangular texture crops'])}
